<title>USA: TABLE - Alteon Inc Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Alteon Inc Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>RAMSEY, N.J. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Months Ended   Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				     June 30,	   June 30,</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Investment Income   $853	$1,185	  $409	  $577</p>
<p>Preferred Stock</p>
<p>  Dividends	     360	     0	   360	     0</p>
<p> Net Loss	  (12,497)     (5,135)     (6,720)     (2,706)</p>
<p>Net Loss Per Share to</p>
<p>Common Stockholders</p>
<p>			 (0.80)	(0.33)	(0.43)	(0.17)</p>
